LICENCE: NOT YET CHOSEN

This repository is published for reading and running, but no licence has been
granted yet. The owner (MADRiD) is choosing between:

  1. MIT for the code, with the station's own media (films, test card, puppet,
     audio) under CC BY-NC 4.0, or
  2. a single CC BY-NC 4.0 for everything.

Until a licence file replaces this one, all rights are reserved. Third-party
material (archive.org / Moving Image Archive programmes, three.js, cannon-es)
keeps its own licence; see THIRD_PARTY.md.
